A new episode of Henry Danger led into the ceremony, while a new episode of Knight Squad served as the lead-out.
Nominations were announced on February 26, 2018. Unlike past years where the voting periods for all categories opened all at once, one genre opened up to voting per week, along with several show-only category voting windows. For the movie categories, voting was opened on February 26, with voting on music categories opened on March 5, television voting beginning on March 12, and a variety of miscellaneous categories on March 19. [ 5 ] Winners are listed first and in boldface . [ 7 ] [ 8 ] [ 9 ]
The following are nominations for awards from Nickelodeon's international networks, which had the categories and awards presented during continuity during their individual airings of the main American ceremony.",ok
gossipcop-856426,https://www.glamourmagazine.co.uk/gallery/miley-cyrus-style-evolution-fashion-photos,Miley Cyrus's style revolution,867084276252233728	867084284447793152	867084282602205184	867084281910239232	867084309219299328	867085129998585856	867085169357864960	867085421062180864	867085498644398080	867085508890869760	867085530466459649	867085552545275904	867085561886003200	867085791100588033	867085919114940416	867085975339515904	867085991344877568	867086281070837760	867087501936033792	867087629388587009	867088798588555265	867089552720015360	867089983626248193	867090072109277184	867091807275933696	867091814074810368	867091816050446336	867091825932124160	867091824401276928	867092680475463680	867094217205571584	867094322231091201	867094705275891712	867096494700204033	867098578606534656	867099176521400320	867099801753575424	867099928190910464	867100716321656833	867102871866626048	867102878388764672	867102877839368192	867102877658918913	867102889541386240	867102899599310848	867102901658763264	867104129893765121	867107892687642624	867110557266190336	867111924936343556	867146005267009536	867192510157860864	867412369739141120,0,glamourmagazine.co.uk,30,"It's pretty safe to say Miley Cyrus is a fashion chameleon. She's gone from Disney Princess to LA teen icon, a crop-top wearing minx with a penchant for studs and leather (and a wrecking ball), and now she's a ""Malibu"" boho babe.
And so it begins. Back in 2006, before Hannah Montana made her a) blonde, and b) a worldwide star, Miley appeared on the red carpet in a tweed blazer and flared jeans. Little did she know how much shorter her denim choices would get over the years…
Aw! Miley is cute as a button in this outfit – whilst we wouldn’t advocate white boots, knee-length shorts and a sheer top as a regular outfit, this is exactly the kind of outfit we’d have picked at her age.
In 2007, the actress is in full-on Montana-mode, with her blonde bangs, sequins and colour co-ordinated outfit.
A 15-year-old Miley already manages to outshine her father (especially in the hair stakes) by this simple get-up and abundance of necklaces.
A world-away from 2013’s twerking, here a 16-year-old Cyrus embodied the American teen dream: demure, sweet and innocent.
A far cry from pre-teen Hannah Montana,the 15-year-old popstar looked scarily older than her years. But this Roberto Cavalli dress teamed with a messy up-do and hoops is a notable success in Miley’s history of red carpet fashion.
Donning a gold and black super-mini for her 16th birthday Miley managed to transform into a present herself. She accessorised the look with an über-pout and coquetteish hand on hip pose.
Still only 16 Miley sported a grungier, grown-up look. A forecast for things to come?
A date with the Queen definitely called for a full-length orange gown. Although we’re not sure about the Rapunzel inspired locks...
Heading into glam territory now with the super long fairy tale hair and flowing white gown (by A-list fave Marchesa), the singer looked miles older than your average 16-year-old.
Miley continued to dress beyond her years with this mature and full-length Hervé Légér by Max Azria asymmetrical gown. Just the right amount of fake tan, too. Just.
Miley attended the Oscars in 2009 kitted out in complete OTT Hollywood glamour.
2009 - the year of the ra-ra dress. Much like the ra-ra skirt circa 2004, only waaay more boho. Together with her Kardashian inspired hair-style Miley looked the epitome of American teen star.
Taking the next step (literally: clock that 2009 crossover leg pose) in her style metamorphosis, Miley looked part of the fashion elite when she wore an embellished Hervé Légér minidress with some chic Sergio Rossi shoes.
Oh wow. It seems as though Miley is channelling other good girl gone bad star Christina Aguilera during her Dirrty years.
Miley’s style evolution rapidly advanced at the beginning of 2010 with this stunning Jenny Packham gown at the Oscars. And was that quiff slightly prophetic of things to come?
Miley chanelled dungeon dominatrix with this unique ensemble and made sure every 16-year-old had a studded collar and over-the-elbow leather gloves on their Christmas list.
Finally, she is having some sartorial downtime, as every 17-year-old should. Although the LA extensions are somewhat incongruous with the comfy leggings and baggy Iron Maiden top, but you know, she can’t let everything go.
One of her best yet. Slouchy white shirt. Check. Thigh-grazing denim cut-offs. Check. Minimal hair and make-up. Check. So Miranda Kerr.
At this point Miley began taking style tips from Justin Bieber (sans the knee-high boots) - she even nicked his entourage.
Back to her country roots, she's even ditched her extensions for this understated look - hurrah! The easy T and denim cut-offs finally created a relaxed look.
Did somebody say Vanessa Hudgens? Miley has clearly been taking tips from her fellow ex-Disney starlet here.
The actresses boho streak continues – this time she opted for a floral maxi.
This elegant dress teamed with a slicked back updo, is part of what we’re calling Miley’s ‘nude’ period – when she wore a lot of red carpet friendly maxi dresses in pale peach tones.
Her red carpet transformation continues apace – this white modern frock and sideswept ‘do was pure Hollywood glamour.
While she was nailing it on the red carpet, Miley hadn’t quite reached the stratospheric heights of off-duty style icon yet – we just can’t get on board with those suspender tights.
Here she went totally 80s with her high-waisted jeans and power-shoulder jacket – the mid-length cut, however, signals a huge improvement in Miley’s style…
…woah. Check out those abs! Miley showed off her pilates-honed physique in a cropped top and maxi skirt by Emilio Pucci. It’s haute boho and we love it.",ok
gossipcop-5071479335,www.intouchweekly.com/posts/emma-watson-robert-pattinson-dating-149532,New Couple Emma Watson and Robert Pattinson Seemingly Go Public at 2018 Golden Globes (EXCLUSIVE),954382022671204353	954385226603544576	954396978896691207	954746887814483973	954761456704081920	954762079449133056	954841226200604673	954869949809410048	955012110865567744,1,intouchweekly.com,97,"It’s been less than two months since news broke that Emma Watson split from tech entrepreneur William “Mack” Knight. But she’s already moved on — with Robert Pattinson .
