144	904306084990595073	904315556790018048	904348534757089280	904348862533566464	904371118424850433	904375006876065792	904404395399536645	904438226466643968	904454140843188224	904471567102386177	904507557376647168	904536615120502786	904580455332118528	904626434559418369	904635210456858624	904645997355302912	904671289926934529	904692922985193473	904716187342434305	904781771040055300	914930819583631361	915156322869563392,0,elitedaily.com,85,"As per usual, one of Hollywood's favorite couples left fans swooning. This time, it didn't take much to muster up all of the lovey dovey feels — just two black jackets. A photo of Selena Gomez and The Weeknd's matching outfits takes #relationshipgoals to new levels and proves a tough but chic look is a perfect date ensemble.
