gossipcop-920744,http://popcrush.com/adrift-trailer-shailene-woodley-sam-claflin/,Shailene Woodley and Sam Claflin Are Lovers Lost at Sea in ‘Adrift’ Trailer,974023377835954181	974024470833885184	974024559669243904	974024744931487744	974024919259500544	974025723349528582	974026208743747584	974027628901433351	974028016736260098	974032651471466496	974036960913362946	974052483030048768	974060928642830336	974068398450765824	974084164730478592	974095202305609728	974132311003418625	974193001810468864	974201069881393152	974202378571350016	974235295402156032	974469904446484485	974567725585453056	974610577577267200	974610597710123010	974610602768326661	1004784511589154818,0,popcrush.com,75,"Divergent 's Shailene Woodley and Hunger Games star Sam Claflin's latest romance, Adrift , is a journey of love, survival, and seat-gripping suspense. Or perhaps, more precisely, what Titanic might've panned out like were Nicholas Sparks ever to scribe a novelization in a similar vein.
