'Because you've stepped in and you felt as her husband, you would want to come in and pick up the pieces?' she asked.
'I also felt as a husband we should discuss this as a family, before you just packed your bags and went,' he said. 'There was no consideration, I guess. I mean that's just how it is. Catelynn wants a pig, she gets a pig. Catelynn wants a horse, she'll buy the horse.'
'I think I'm constantly in this care taking position, all the time,' he revealed.
'And that's why you're tired?' she asked.
