gossipcop-881988237,www.adweek.com/digital/boy-george-pays-justin-bieber-a-backhanded-compliment/,Boy George Pays Justin Bieber a ‘Beautiful’ Backhanded Compliment,819309208021663744	819309306113880072	819310312960757766	819311230267461632	819311676126334977	819313023168970754	819337920826015746	819337954489499648	819337991487426560	819338015571120129	819413618294931456	819496996130131969	819509994387226624	819741344788840448	819939358002348033,1,adweek.com,65,"New York freelance writer Lawrence Ferber logged a fun interview with Boy George for Dallas Voice. Celebrity Q&A’s are ultimately all about the questions, and Ferber asked some fabulous ones.
