Tennis champion Serena Williams shared a behind-the-scenes photo and video diary on Instagram, documenting her glamorous makeover in preparation for Meghan Markle and Prince Harry's wedding.
Williams stole kisses from her baby, Olympia, as her friend Jill Smoller and her husband, Reddit co-founder Alexis Ohanian, looked on in one of her Instagram Stories.
