'All in all, I would suggest a body bronzer or tinted moisturizer to give your legs a flawless look - this is just too much work!'
Celebrity make-up artist Pati Dubroff also told the website it would cause make-up to be rubbed off on clothing and furniture and said the craze was 'out of control'.
All of the make-up is then painstakingly blended together with a brush, so all traces of the lines fade
