gossipcop-8975289821,abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/celebrities-react-donald-trumps-state-union-speech/story?id=52738754,Celebrities react to Donald Trump's State of the Union speech,958561851872370689	958741752193544193	958745237417086978	958746525458485249	958746948177219584	958748901569449984	958748970473410561	958748979671584770	958757269696544768	958757948389580800	958758178828713985	958763157807300616	958769114637627392	958777037132513280	958822923829235713	958859453541093376	958894351274389504	958941325545607168	958984275424174081	959041989068156928	959078565202587649	959116481677221890	959138631893078017	959176217625812992	959235597830418432	959272509085544448	959337603488198656	959422691278278657,1,abcnews.go.com,61,"&#151; -- President Trump tried to strike an upbeat tone Tuesday night for his first State of the Union address, but he still drew strong reactions from celebrities on Twitter.
