gossipcop-936030,https://www.cbsnews.com/news/billboard-music-awards-2018-list-of-winners/,Billboard Music Awards 2018 list of winners,996906180202164224	996906267884118016	996907714537078784	996907744522330114	996907883110457345	996907885924790272	996907964077228032	996910085082411009	996911355851673600	996912762377809921	996913716053626880	996914000377114624	996916827598082048	996980217552961536	996980234112176128	996980415348006912	996980427565957120	996980432750239744	996980429784846339	996980445760970752	996980444737556480	996980447094673409	996980458687787008	996980471673257984	996980482180026368	996980648182239232	996980661507502080	996980661041889281	996980671213129728	996980675449409536	996980685779894274	996980685779894273	996980693484916736	996980696571895809	996980703828086784	996980703580606464	996980707426697216	996980716444504064	996980714947084289	996980729488793600	996980743950798848	996980750753914885	996980763844403200	996980761545801729	996980774023909376	996980921365655552	996980932329529344	996980968962625536	996980978479493120	996980981918851072	996980991532109825	996981021156528128	996981032334299137	996981063418351616	996981074076098560	996981166870859777	996981179952893952	996981179525066752	996981182335242241	996981191499833346	996981195157180417	996981215122087941	996981220968943616	996981226497077249	996981236181630978	996981449864765441	996981461130596352	996990051379761153	997009950466564096	997010361286123520	997452991627063298,0,cbsnews.com,43,"LAS VEGAS -- Here are the winners in the top categories at the 2018 Billboard Music Awards, held Sunday at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Las Vegas. Ed Sheeran, who was not at the show, won big, in categories that included top artist and top male artist, while Janet Jackson won the icon award.
