	858808759036125184	858809735083999232	858822139042045953	858827654308524033	858838769948139520	858843248411934721	858912760415096832	858914907248447488	858961747436335104	865736547026513925,0,pagesix.com,44,"Zayn Malik mysteriously hurt his foot and is now using a wheelchair to get around.
On Saturday, the former One Direction singer appeared in New York City’s NoHo neighborhood sitting firmly in a black wheelchair. Someone pushed him onto the sidewalk and into girlfriend Gigi Hadid ’s apartment building.
Malik, 24, wore a black Cartoon Network t-shirt and light-color ripped jeans. His left pant leg was rolled up to show his injured foot, which was covered in a white and blue sock.
“Zayn injured his foot but is fine,” a rep for the star told Page Six but would not elaborate on further details.
It’s unclear if he plans to attend this year’s Met Gala slated for Monday, May 1.
