The singer later took to Twitter again, though, to not only deny his original tweet was about his ex-girlfriend, but to shut down any trolls who were attacking the model on social media. He wrote:
We're as confused as you are about what's going on, but one thing is for sure: Zayn is still full of love for Gigi.
