gossipcop-485281376,www.mercurynews.com/2018/06/25/why-did-kanye-west-think-that-kim-kardashian-might-divorce-him/,Why did Kanye West think that Kim Kardashian might divorce him?,1011377010717757441	1011381087757635585	1011401520410218499	1011410221703417856	1011410744850690049	1011411984611356673	1011583932087914497	1011588914992144389	1011597835828170754	1011623441739509760,1,mercurynews.com,63,"Kanye West reportedly thought his marriage to Kim Kardashian might be nearing its end.
