""I'm still the same. You all moved. You all went too f– far out, you lost everybody,"" she said. ""A lot of us, no matter who we voted for, we don't want to see our president fail. Because we don't want [Vice President Mike] Pence. Are you f– kidding me? You want Pence? You want Pence for the freaking president? Well then, zip that f– lip.""",ok
