The current cast includes Heidi Montag, Spencer Pratt, Audrina Patridge, Jason Wahler, Frankie Delgado, Justin Bobby Brescia, and Stephanie Pratt.
Lauren Conrad, Lo Bosworth, and Kristin Cavallari have opted not to participate in the returning reality series.
