Bathing beauties: Alana Haim, Rachel Plateen, Martha Hunt, Halston Sage, Cara Delevingne, Swift Britany Maack, Abigail Anderson, Rose, Harley Gusman, Lively, Gigi Hadid, and Karlie Kloss in 2016
