A conspiracy theory that falsely claims Avril Lavigne died 14 years ago resurfaced over the weekend. And according to Gossip Cop , the 32-year-old Canadian songstress is ""mildly amused"" by the reemergence of the death hoax that suggested she died in 2003 at the height of her career, and was replaced by a look-alike called Melissa Vandella.
