gossipcop-881886,http://tasteofcountry.com/faith-hill-turning-50-proud/,Faith Hill Is ‘Happy to Be 50′ and Isn’t Afraid to Say It!,910979684782845952	910979996277231619	910980182676295681	910980497739800576	910980746315161600	910982244935729152	910982854460534785	910987143119548416	910994119870304256	910996193861341184	911009088296902656	911053618182156288,0,tasteofcountry.com,58,"Preach it, Faith Hill ! The country superstar spoke the truth about turning 50 during a recent stop on the 2017 Soul2Soul Tour with husband Tim McGraw .
