93,0,nbclosangeles.com,79,"Sony Pictures just released the third trailer for ""Spider-Man: Homecoming"" giving audiences a better idea of just how involved Tony Stark (a.k.a. Iron Man) will be in Peter Parker's journey to becoming a superhero in his own right.
