Rodriguez expressed disgust at the way his former brother-in-law was using his daughters in an effort to turn the media against him for his own gain.
He told the Post: “I may have not been perfect in the past, but I am very proud of who I am, and how I live my life now and it is important to me that my daughters feel the same way.”
He said he wouldn’t have even responded to such “false” accusations were it not for his daughters. “I would never want them to think this is true,” he said. “Unfortunately, however, there are some people who would do anything for money, except work.”",ok
