gossipcop-3054032558,www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-5580823/Kylie-Jenner-takes-Twitter-refute-report-Kris-Jenner-guiding-Travis-Scott-Kanye-West.html,Kylie Jenner slams claim Kris is guiding Travis Scott and Kanye West,841006926272053249	841011134039748608	841011681597636608	841013826992590848	841013833305014272	841013830314467328	841013839940399104,1,dailymail.co.uk,68,"By ROSS MCDONAGH FOR DAILYMAIL.COM and PAUL CHAVEZ FOR DAILYMAIL.COM
Published: 03:11 EDT, 5 April 2018 | Updated: 09:37 EDT, 5 April 2018
Kylie Jenner took to Twitter on Wednesday to refute a report that Kris Jenner has started guiding the careers of her rapper boyfriend Travis Scott and brother-in-law Kanye West .
The 20-year-old reality star tweeted: 'this isn't true' along with a link to an article by Complex based on a report by Page Six .
The 62-year-old momager is grandmother to both the rappers' children; Kanye shares North, four, Saint, two, and Chicago, two months with Kris's daughter Kim Kardashian , while Travis and Kris' youngest daughter Kylie welcomed baby Stormi also two months ago.
Momager: Kris Jenner, shown in October 2015 in Paris with Kanye West and Travis Scott, reportedly has started managing their careers, but Kylie Jenner shot it down
Not so fast: Soon after the report surfaced, however, Kylie tweeted that it was 'not true'
According to Page Six , the momager was behind West's parting with longtime manager Izvor 'Izzy' Zivkovic, as well as Scott's departure from Mark Gillespie.
'They've been off and on for years,' said a source told the site of West and Zivkovic.
'But Kris is in [West's]. Kanye's been making changes and [he and Zivkovic] have grown apart — but Kris definitely gives her opinion and Kanye's all ears.
'She's about brand building and is gangster at it,' the insider said.
Grandma: The 62-year-old is grandmother to both the rappers' children; Kanye shares North, four, Saint, two, and Chicago, two months with Kris's daughter Kim Kardashian
Newest addition: Travis and Kris's youngest daughter Kylie welcomed baby Stormi also two months ago
'She also told Travis Scott to fire Mark Gillespie,' the source added. 'They are 100 percent part of that Kardashian-Jenner brand.'
Scott left Gillespie's Three Six Zero management last month. Kanye left Zivkovic last week.
Zivkovic had been sharing management duties with Justin Bieber's manager Scooter Braun; the former oversaw musical interests while the later everything else, including West's fashion endeavors.
Teaming up: Both rappers are reportedly collaborating on a new track, and have been seen recording in Jackson Hole, Wyoming
According to the site, both rappers are collaborating on a new track, and have been seen recording in Jackson Hole, Wyoming.
While Kris may not have much experience in rap, her people and brand management credentials are second to none.
In a swamped field of reality stars cloying for popularity, she has elevated each of her five daughters, with no discernible skills, to stand-alone superstar status.
Like a boss: While Kris may not have much experience in rap, her people and brand management credentials are second to none",ok
gossipcop-3482407740,1037theq.iheart.com/content/2017-07-28-miranda-lambert-refuses-to-talk-politics-you-cant-win-anyway/,Miranda Lambert Refuses To Talk Politics: 'You Can't Win Anyway',310450363931185152	890693514899673088	890750201530634240	890938858132713473	890939625841274880	890940013462081536	890940112338653184	890940810858024961	890941543040811009	890941766052057091	890942283742408704	890942343964184576	890942428471062528	890942657458982912	890944893832634373	890944985075503104	890945796216168448	890948897367093248	890949171464876036	890949449903722497	890949590484176896	890951114056769536	890951865113989120	890955120862744580	890955118883090432	890961187227258881	890966482594803712	890967950966108160	890980559782129664	890988767074553856	890996702005653504	891014825744023552	891017020145324032	891021256526630913	891041497801515010	891044232114339840	891044451593932801	891046931971141632	891048351017336832	891056466710409216	891095520290238466	891098344659050497	891102259383332864	891122735899959296	891122786286088192	891127829852819457	891146507768012800	891146594145501189	891193440398188544	891209695347830784	891250736838959106	891297039241404417	891851291068174336	892044746989993984	892046014902935552	892047107527385089	892054262825467904	892056431477870594	892168494388850689	892221732760805377	892238368440012802	892240782249295872	892244800996552704	912491357238890496	1017379060547293185,1,1037theq.iheart.com,64,"Miranda Lambert explains in her new Billboard cover story why she refuses to discuss politics or sing political-minded songs. “You can’t win anyway,” she says.
The Dixie Chicks infamously faced a career-changing backlash after Natalie Maines slammed George W. Bush over the Iraq war during a concert in 2003. But in recent years, particularly with the growth of Twitter, it’s become extremely commonplace for artists to weigh in on current events. In fact, in addition to singers like Lady Gaga and Katy Perry actively campaigning for Hillary Clinton, many celebrities use Twitter to rip Donald Trump on a daily basis.
But Lambert has no interest in following suit. In the new article, released on Thursday, the author writes , “When I ask Lambert if she thinks that at this moment in history — with, among other things, this particular president in office — there is an opening for her to make the kind of issue-oriented songs [Loretta] Lynn became known for, Lambert is quick to dismiss the idea.”
She is quoted as saying in response, “I am a 100 percent believer in not ever using the platform that I’ve built for anything other than music, because music to me is an escape from your own reality. I don’t want to go to a show and hear somebody preach about their opinions.” And when pushed, Lambert stood her ground.
“It’s so divided [in politics], you can’t win anyway. And what are you winning?” she asked. “For someone to agree with you, and now you’ve spoken your piece and pissed off many other people, just for one person to go, ‘She’s right’? It doesn’t do any good.” Lambert added, “I’m a country singer. We talk about tears in our beers.”
Lambert’s stance is in-line with that of another female country icon. As Gossip Cop reported in February, Reba McEntire argued on “The View” that entertainers shouldn’t talk politics . Elsewhere in the Billboard story, Lambert also discusses her decision not to do press for her last album, The Weight Of These Wings , to avoid discussing her divorce from Blake Shelton. “I just didn’t need to talk about the record,” she told the magazine.
Lambert continues, “If you want to hear my side of the story or my opinion of what happened, it’s all on there. There’s no mystery anymore — take from it what you will.” She also revealed she co-wrote “Vice” the very day the split went public in 2015. “I walked in with guns blazing,” she shared. “I just knew one thing: I didn’t want a breakup record.”",ok
gossipcop-935197,https://www.glamourmagazine.co.uk/gallery/50-things-you-didnt-know-about-the-kardashians,100 fascinating things you didn’t know about the Kardashians,,0,glamourmagazine.co.uk,60,"America's most famous family monopolise our news and Instagram feeds , but if you think after all these years of literally Keeping Up With The Kardashians , you know everything there is to know about our Kardashian-Jenners, including the full family tree - well, my friend, you're very mistaken.
Here are 100 things - yes, one hundred things - we bet you didn't know about the world famous family...
Kim Kardashian is a little box of BIG surprises, isn't she? In a video interview with Elle , Kim had to rewrite (or confirm) weird headlines about the Kardashians. After reading the headline Fear Not, Kim Kardashian's Hair Will Always Be Done, Per Her Will' she confirmed that there is indeed a clause in her will stating that in case of a debilitating illness, she needs to have her hair, makeup AND nails done at all times. ""I made a section [in my will] that if I am so out of it that I can't even communicate and I am like s***ting on myself, I definitely need my hair, my nails and my makeup done,"" she said on camera. Errr, okay then...
It's well known that the Kardashian-Jenner family is rolling in it - and it doesn't look like that'll change anytime soon. In fact, their net worths just keeps on growing. Kylie Jenner is set to become a billionaire by the end of the 2022 with her cosmetics line and steal Kim 's throne as the wealthiest of them all. While Kris Jenner just signed a deal to extend the Keeping Up with the Kardashians contract with its network. The deal's value, you ask? A whopping 150 million dollars.
Remember Ray J, Kim Kardashian 's noughties boyfriend, with whom she made a sex tape? Well, nowadays Ray is also a reality star. And his future in the telly seems just as promising as Kim's (if not more). The singer stars in Love & Hip Hop , a reality series that has on its first season out-rated Keeping Up With The Kardashians , with 3.6 million viewers. Woah!
Mrs. Kardashian-West took to her website share with fans hers and Kanye 's post-concert traditions. In between pics of Kanye's concerts, she writes: ""After every show, I always greet Kanye with a black Versace towel and a glass of water in a Versace glass. And there was a fun slushy machine in the friends and family room"".
After North West was born, Kim sent fake pictures of ""baby North"" to friends, just to test them and see who would try to sell the shots to tabloids. Surprise, surpise... they tried.
Kim also shared on her website 20 things no one knows about her. Which included: she sleeps with her eyes slightly open and it scares the shit out of people; she has a fear of heights because when she was 20 years-old she went sky diving; she knows the alphabet in sign language; she hates cardboard and the sound the Starbucks sleeve makes when you take it off (so she leaves the room and has someone take it off for her). WTF Kim?!
North's first birthday was Coachella themed. The Kidchella party, as invitees called it, had even a ferris wheel and all festival-worthy décor. Baby North wore a flower headband and suede ensemble - adorable.
Kim Kardashian revealed in a tweet that she blow-dries all of her jewellery before she puts it on. But why?! In the tweet, Kim explained: ""Weird Kim fact - I blow dry all my jewelry before I put it on! I can't stand putting on cold jewelry, it gives me the chills!"" (sic)
Clever, but also, is jewellery chills a big problem?!
It turns out that Kim Kardashian-West has a very special secret skill - she can smell tooth decay. How lovely. She claims her hidden talent is recognising the ""specific"" scent of a dental cavity. She said: ""I can smell when someone has a cavity. It's a very specific smell - not a bad-breath smell - but something that is really strong.""
Kim Kardashian has been making money off her love of selfies. That's right, when Kim attended a Revolve party in the Hamptons recently, she was reportedly paid $700,000 to spend an hour taking selfies with the 'influencer' guests. She was apparently there for just over an hour before being flown away on a private jet. She's a business woman, there's no denying it.
Did you know little North West is learning to play the violin? Kim shared a snap form one of her lessons on Snapchat recently. Fairy costume optional.
Kris Jenner recently said that she was considering changing her name back to Kardashian. Imagine it: Kris Kardashian. We're so used to Jenner. But wait a sec, Kris later said that she won't be going through with the formal name change out of respect for her daughters Kendall and Kylie. Speaking to Australian radio hosts Kyle and Jackie 'O' Henderson, Kris said: ""It happens to be two younger girls who have an amazing dad and I think I'm going to stay right where I am."" She continued: ""It sounded good for a minute, but I went 'you just have to respect the relationship of the entire family'"".
Kim Kardashian has revealed that the indent on her bum is due to injections issued for her psoriasis and NOT because she's had implants, FYI.
During a live stream on her website, Kim Kardashian revealed that she has injections in her bum to cure her psoriasis, a skin conditions which causes red, dry patches. This gave her an indent on her bum, the reason many believe she's enhanced her famous feature.
She said: “I went to go get a cortisone shot in my butt. I lived right behind Kitson. One of my neighbours was a dermatologist at Cedars."" She continued: “I go in there and he’s like, ‘There’s a one in a billion chance that you will get a huge indent in your butt.’ Of course I get a huge indent on my butt.""
“There is a picture of me in Miami wearing an electric blue dress, and another picture of me walking down Robertson. You see the indent. And I think that’s when the rumours started, ‘She’s had implants.’”
Kendall Jenner revealed on her app recently that she didn't attend her own high school prom. Speaking about her decision, she said: ""So, I'm not sure if you knew this about me, but I didn't go to prom. I feel like - whatever, it's not that big of a deal!""
But what does she recommend to do instead? ""Use the excuse to veg out in your comfies with classic HS flicks and homemade pizza."" Sounds like our kind of night. ""Just remember, you embracing your 'own thing' is pretty much the most attractive trait a girl can have. No matter what you do this weekend, have a blast!"" Kendall finished - Sound advice if you ask us.
In an interview with PEOPLE Stylewatch , the youngest Jenner revealed just how long it takes to groom her perfect talons. She said: ""My mum always drilled it in my head to have nice, pretty nails. It's just really important to her.""
Going on she said: ""Anytime she meets someone, she'll look at [their] fingernails. I never cared when I was younger and I hated getting my nails done. It just took up my play time. But she likes pretty nails, so that's where I got my nail obsession."" But just how long to Kylie's take? Brace yourselves... ""I get my nails done every week. I've sat literally for four to five hours doing them. I used to spend so much time doing the craziest artwork.""
Cheers, Kylie. You've made us feel worse about our bus ride rush job.
Khloe Kardashian shocked when she revealed that she was banned from giving a speech at her sister Kim's wedding. Speaking as a guest on James Cordon's The Late Late Show in February 2016 she said: ""I wasn't allowed to give a speech because I tend to just ramble and I think I'm giving a compliment but maybe I'm not saying the right thing.""
Khloe explained: ""So at the wedding Kim was like 'Well you can't give a speech.'"" She later told the audience about how brother in-law Kanye teased her with the mic: ""He was like taunting me, one ranter to another ranter"". In other (non-surprising) news, Khloe revealed that Kanye's speech was an entire 45 minutes long, saying: ""His speech was epic and went on for like 45 minutes.""
We daren't think about what that speech consisted of...
In news that had made us all feel like slobs in comparison, Khloe Kardashian recently revealed she changes her bed sheets once every two days. Writing on her blog, she revealed: ""You dolls know I'm insane with keeping my house in order, but I always thought everyone else was as much of a neat freak as me! I looked up what the Internet recommends and found out that maybe I'm just a little bit more fanatical about being clean than I thought."" The Kocktails with Khloe host then revealed she washes her sheets every two days, explaining: ""Obviously, if I'm not in town or not sleeping in my bed I'll wait a little, but the sheets definitely go in the wash every time after a spray tan.""
To be fair, if we had to time (and the staff) we'd do the same. There's nothing like some fresh sheets.
It's a little known fact that Kim Kardashian and Spencer Pratt used to 'hang'. The typically smug Spencer Pratt decided to unearth the old friendship on Twitter recently when retweeted an old tweet Kim sent him in 2009 asking him if he was in LA. Alongside the tweet he wrote ""Wow things have def changed"".
Kendall once said that Tyga was her favourite rapper, and he even performed at her sweet sixteen. The whole thing was caught on camera in an earlier episode of KUWTK where Kendall and Kylie (then 14) can be seen dancing to Tyga's performance. Little did they know, eh? See the clip here .
Rob Kardashian is currently dating Blac Chyna which makes things kiiiind of awkward considering she is Kylie's boyfriend Tyga's baby-mumma. It just gets stranger.
