Kris and Kylie Jenner once showed off their new $10,200 Toto toilets on Instagram. The toilet uses Actilight technology, and has an integrated UV light, special glaze to get rid of dirt, heated seat, deodoriser, and warm water sprays. Woah.
In a recent post on her website, Kendall admitted she never wanted to take modelling classes. She said: ""I never took any modeling classes, It was definitely something I just had to learn over time. She continued:""Honestly, I think the only way you really learn how to model is just experiencing it and being involved in it, doing different shoots. I never really had a desire to take classes, either—it was just 100 percent experience.""
In an interview with Complex magazine in July 2015, Khloe Kardashian spoke about her ex-husband, Lamar Odom, saying: ""I think Lamar’s gonna always be that person [for me] but that’s what made it so special. Even if I had it for five years or whatever, it was the best ever and I’m grateful I did. Some people don’t get that ever and I had that magic for a long time.”
When asked which of her many siblings she’d prefer to be stuck on a desert island with, Kendall revealed it was Khloe .
Kris Jenner admitted to having plastic surgery before Kim’s wedding, saying: ""I needed a little freshening up for the wedding. Just doing what a girl's gotta do!""
