Last week, Victoria’s Secret revealed Rita Ora would be amongst the singers performing at the legendary fashion production.
The singer will be joined by acts including The Chainsmokers, Halsey, and Shawn Mendes.
Kelsea Ballerini, Bebe Rexha, and The Struts are also set to take to the stage.
While the event will take place this week, viewers won’t get to see the action straight away. Instead, they’ll have to wait until the holiday special airs on the small screen.
American TV network ABC will air this year’s annual show, on Sunday, December 2.",ok
