gossipcop-934055,https://www.usmagazine.com/celebrity-news/news/queer-eyes-karamo-brown-engaged-to-ian-jordan/,Queer Eye’s Karamo Brown Engaged to Ian Jordan,994542076762128385	994543564045668352	994544869442895873	994545035000664064	994546590852542464	994546668241543171	994547225253511168	994548127314083840	994548247237623808	994610833467609090	994633640285032448	994847409590231042,0,usmagazine.com,46,"Queer Eye star Karamo Brown proposed to his boyfriend of eight years, Ian Jordan , on Wednesday, May 9 — and it’s safe to say they will have one stylish wedding.
