45490059210752	1042432710550216704	1042895617893298176	1043211641372979200	1043927009360048128	1044013670009851904	1044284754458279937	1044719454758801408	1045417181335490561	1045473391980015616	1045679982092210176	1045766909277466625	1046275344683159552	1046461847921192963	1046463086830505984	1046579448559087616	1046725028224659456	1046939377014906885	1046967025480929281	1047007549088837632	1047065814401257472	1047122308278706177	1047159612238188544	1047624466530889728	1047668471037870080	1048960631506980871	1049104777689358336	1050429567582789633	1050462165616877568	1050484614131781636	1050516466808774657	1050518504477200386	1050521937426956288	1050526973309665280	1050598499480268805	1050601216009326592	1050631990783827968	1050756656949317632	1050907907766870018	1050907957876203520	1050923172655185920	1050937904879550464	1050943848648589312	1050980586884456449	1051097085863432193	1051130886714994693	1051192598726148097	1051193817536364544	1051410856389402624	1051653587401695237	1053201608626991104	1053246907605180417	1053315941658963970	1053639524964683778	1053707479501008896	1053843362720047104	1054206970302029830	1054209290167353344	1054318977101443072	1054404474444398598	1054531618776457216	1054614259991080960	1055178212274266112	1055178497096908802	1055178575928848384	1055179814691311616	1055496634702970880	1055496668915884032	1056223586556538880	1056289215552442368	1056331880633647105	1056925473886924806	1057052689861881857	1057400639716802561	1057489562333782016	1057503799588372482	1058056580992811008	1058712756885565440	1059842740274499584	1059969817254510592	1060607303941009408	1060695088576319488,1,nydailynews.com,82,"While tout le monde was buzzing about the shocking, $10 million Paris robbery of Kim Kardashian, French authorities began putting together the pieces of her horrifying ordeal.
As Kardashian put distance between herself and the swanky hotel where she feared for her life Sunday night, details of the holdup , supplied by sources and her reps, began to emerge.
They painted a harrowing picture of a woman who feared she would be killed — or raped — by masked men.
“This was a life and death matter,” a source told the Daily News. “That’s what’s important. The fact people keep focusing on what was stolen is irrelevant. She might have not been on this planet anymore.
“She begged for them to let her live and (said) she has babies at home,” the source said. “Then they wrapped her mouth in tape and put her in the bathtub.”
Citing sources, celebrity gossip site TMZ.com said Kardashian was in bed after a night on the town and wearing a robe when two men stormed the room .
She initially feared they would rape her. She tried to call her bodyguard, but one of the bandits snatched the phone before she could complete the call, according to TMZ.
Kardashian later told cops the men spoke only French, except for one word — ring — a reference to a new, widely publicized bauble she had received from her doting husband, rap star Kanye West.
She told them where it was before they taped her mouth shut. They also bound her ankles with duct tape and zip-tied her hands with plastic handcuffs before putting her in the tub, a source told The News.
Before the robbery, five men threatened a concierge with a weapon and forced him to enter Kardashian’s private two-story residence at the hotel. The suspects made off with a jewelry box, a ring and a pair of cell phones.
Meanwhile, a Kardashian friend who was sleeping in a downstairs bedroom heard the commotion and locked herself in a bathroom.
There, she called Kardashian’s bodyguard, who arrived two minutes after the thieves left.
One of the men, who were dressed as police officers, even pointed a handgun at Kardashian’s temple before tying her up, according to various accounts.
A rep said the reality star was “badly shaken but physically unharmed.”
The thieves reportedly fled on bicycles, authorities said.
Kardashian’s children, North and Saint West, were not in the room at the time.
The five thieves remain at large. Still, many details about the robbery remained a mystery, even after the distraught reality star bolted the City of Light and met up with West, in New York.
Missing from the chaotic scene was Kardashian’s usually ever-present bodyguard, Pascal Duvier, who was shadowing sisters Kourtney Kardashian and Kendall Jenner at the time, since Kim had turned in for the night, according to TMZ.
Duvier was by Kim Kardashian’s side last week when a notorious prankster ran up and tried to kiss her famous derriere. Duvier tackled the man mid-pucker.
“My security @PascalDuvier is a G,” Kim tweeted after the incident.
Hours before the hotel robbery, Kardashian had posted a picture online of herself with Duvier in the background, joking that he was always in her shot.
Cops also questioned a photographer who had posed as a cop to get a picture of the star in a restaurant earlier in the week, according to The Sun newspaper.
French police force Brigade de Repression du Banditisme, which specializes in armed robbery investigations, is leading the Kardashian heist probe. The elite investigators are known for their ongoing case against the gang known throughout Europe as the “Pink Panthers.”
CBS’s 60 Minutes credited the notorious jewel thieves with over 370 capers worth $500 million.
It’s unclear if the mysterious gang — made up of mostly former soldiers from Yugoslavia — had any part in the Monday theft.
The “Pink Panthers” are known for speed, minimal violence and meticulous planning that utilizes disguises.
The so-called No Address Hotel is a historic private mansion that was converted into luxury apartments with hotel-like accommodations. Among its guests have been Prince, Madonna and Leonardo DiCaprio.
Kardashian, in town for Fashion Week, bid Paris a quick au revoir, fleeing Europe within hours of talking to the police
After her private jet touched down at Teterboro Airport, Kardashian, 35, was joined by a battalion of bodyguards in a head-of-state-like motorcade featuring at least eight SUVs for the ride from New Jersey to New York.
The first member of the family to emerge from the line of vehicles was Kardashian’s mother, Kris Jenner, who was with the TV personality in Paris. Jenner was joined by her boyfriend, Corey Gamble. Kardashian was also accompanied by Duvier, who was questioned by cops, but was not considered a suspect, according to reports.
Kardashian wasn’t wearing her massive wedding band after being photographed with it on Sunday evening in Paris.
The reality star emerged from her car and quickly darted inside her Manhattan apartment with West.
A day earlier West, abruptly stopped his performance mid-song at the Meadows Festival in Queens on Sunday night after learning what happened, telling the audience he had a “family emergency.”
“He wanted to get to her as soon as he could,” the source told People. “He told her that he couldn’t care less about the jewelry; he’s just thankful that she’s okay.” Kardashian — who was in the City of Light for Fashion Week — considered getting robbed one of her “biggest fears,” an insider close to the reality star told People.
“She’s always known the threats are out there, but for something to happen, it’s almost unimaginable,” the source said. “It’s going to take her a very long time to feel safe again.”
With Helene Goutany in Paris, Nancy Dillon, Nicole Hensley",ok
