gossipcop-7158572267,www.vanityfair.com/style/2018/07/prince-harry-meghan-markle-united-states-tour-report,Are Prince Harry and Meghan Markle Coming to the U.S.?,935353939360350208	971672039424749568	994614028977819648	997776305683861505	997778387690237953	1019696417030524928	1019696680759971846	1019696809759920129	1019697241181904897	1019699778509082624	1019754601376092165	1019890752342646784	1019914025662992385	1020088745150767104	1020104281649688576	1020137502215032833	1020153096624779264	1020204999970906112	1020275266449559557	1020306711662522368	1020399123990601728,1,vanityfair.com,54,"The cover of Us Weekly this week features a Photoshopped composite of our pals Prince Harry and Meghan Markle, with an American flag floating just above Meghan’s head. “COMING TO AMERICA!” the cover line shouts (with the similarly all-caps question touted beneath: “BUT IS HER DAD ON THE LIST?”).
