3227649	979376495423578114	979378214412800001	979379708495319041	979379714887479296	979379731761115137	979379737649958912	979379745522638849	979379772248723456	979379811410939904	979379828167200770	979379840968163329	979379979594158080	979379977153114112	979380011336642560	979380015409311746	979380054584111104	979380053699190784	979380265133985792	979380330481307648	979380371275046912	979380439222837248	979380552666177537	979380596240764928	979380615635243008	979380650913525761	979380726880702465	979380815107895296	979380828139638784	979381252016033793	979385802063986688	979390795852652545	979396190839042048	979396884568662016	979396892030357504	979410222778216448	982195850355998721,0,hercampus.com,38,"What’s your Spring Break vibe this year? Maybe you’re hopping on a plane and heading somewhere tropical to enjoy a little sand, sun, and surf. Or, maybe you and your besties are all piling into your car and hitting the road for a wintery getaway, complete with snow angels and fireside hangs. Even if you’re simply planning a relaxing staycation at home (which can sometimes be the *best* way to spend the week, IMO), it’s all about preparation and packing the right things.
