Happy holidays from Khloé, True, and BB Thompson! The happy family posted a super glam and *adorable*​ photo to the 'gram showing off their Christmas party styles. True and Khloé wore coordinating ""Mommy and me"" red satin dresses, while her son wore a cozy black set.
