The Kardashian-Thompson crew is complete...in Khloé's mind at least.
During an appearance on The Kelly Clarkson Show on October 27, the Good American co-founder revealed she's done having children. The news comes just two months after she welcomed her second baby, a son, with ex Tristan via surrogate.""I have one of both, and I think I'm good, shop is closed,"" Kardashian said of having a daughter and a son.
