Remember Tristan Thompson? It may have been a while since you last heard that name so let me refresh your memory. He is the father of Khloé's baby, True, and he allegedly cheated on Khloé literally days before True was born. While Khloé and Tristan have spent the last ten months working on their relationship since the scandal, he has been MIA recently, so has the pair officially broken up?
