Elgort, 23, and Komyshan, 21, have been nearly inseparable — save for a brief breakup in 2014 — since they started dating six years ago. Though fans know they met while they were both attending LaGuardia High School, Komyshan provided more details to Cosmopolitan about their teenage meet-cute.
“I think he had his eye on me because we were in the same lunch period or something,” she shared, adding that she and her friend ran into him on the street. “I didn’t even know he went to my school — I just thought he was really attractive. I looked at him and told my friend, ‘Oh my God, that guy’s so hot,’ and she’s like, ‘Oh that’s Ansel, he goes to LaGuardia.'”
