When the Grammy-nominated star graced the stage with his dapper son, he announced: 'I'm grateful for my biggest blessing. Me and mommy love this boy.'
Dj Khaled is nominated for Video Of The Year, Best Collaboration, Best Hip Hop, and Best Art Direction.
