gossipcop-2836480555,okmagazine.com/photos/pink-lady-gaga-write-anti-madonna-anthem/,Pink & Lady Gaga Are ‘Working Together’ To Write An Anti-Madonna Anthem,928417126557405184,1,okmagazine.com,71,"Pink and Lady Gaga are teaming up to take down Madonna ! According to an OK! insider, the singers are fighting back against the famous pop star after her feud with Lady G. Previously, Madonna accused Gaga of ripping off her song “Express Yourself” to create “Born This Way.” But now, Pink is coming to G’s defense, and helping her write an anthem against the queen of pop!
“Pink feels sorry for Gaga and is taking her side in her Madonna feud ,” the insider told OK! exclusively. “She thinks Gaga’s been treated rotten and is really talented and vulnerable right now.”
“Pink’s a tough girl and she doesn’t like the way Madonna’s been trashing her friend all over town, saying that Gaga’s music is a bad rip-off of hers,” the source continued.
In an interview with Rolling Stone , Madonna admitted she believed Gaga “blatantly ripped off one of my songs.” Then, Madonna’s single “Two Steps Behind Me” was widely considered a dig at Gaga, with lyrics like, “You're a copycat, Where is my royalty? You're a pretty girl, I'll give you that. But stealing my recipe, it's an ugly look.""
Now, the insider says Pink and Gaga “are talking of working together” to get back at Madonna. “They’re writing lyrics that target Madonna as superficial and a fraud,” the insider told OK!
This isn’t the first time Pink has come to Gaga’s defense. Back in February, Pink slammed fans for accusing Gaga of stealing her acrobatic moves for the 2017 Super Bowl Halftime Show performance.
“Let’s celebrate a woman who has the guts to jump off a roof and stand up there in the first place,” Pink said at the time. “Who cares if I flew first? Cause I didn’t! Cirque and Peter Pan have been in the air for years!”
What do you think of Pink and Lady Gaga’s unlikely friendship? Sound off in the comments below!",ok
gossipcop-890871,https://www.usmagazine.com/celebrity-news/news/mandy-moore-mentioned-the-worst-time-as-ryan-adams-split-news-broke-2015271/,"Mandy Moore Mentioned ""The Worst"" Time As Ryan Adams Split News Broke",925824548322398209	925824806229909504	925825191808307200	925826198634102784	925826218410348544	925826346194030592	925826536913084416	925826689195806721	925826993358172160	925827920471392256	925830006999343104	925830209756106753	925830432737853447	925831430323785728	925833822859558912	925845805944029184	925846590224510977	925983148655046656,0,usmagazine.com,69,"Missing him like candy? Mandy Moore took to Instagram to share an emotional post on Friday, Jan. 23 — the same day that news broke that she and husband Ryan Adams are calling it quits.
The singer and actress, 30, posted an image of two orange traffic signs against a cloudy blue sky. The top sign, in the shape of a diamond, reads, ""Mercury Retrograde."" It sits atop a rectangular sign reading, ""PROCEED WITH CAUTION.""
Referencing the planetary movement that is believed to inspire bad luck and unexpected events, Moore captioned the image, ""Message received. #thatexplainsit #theworst.""
The ""Candy"" singer may have been looking for an explanation for the end of her relationship. Moore and her now estranged husband Adams, 40, confirmed their split on Friday, releasing a statement to Us reading , ""Mandy Moore and Ryan Adams have mutually decided to end their marriage of almost 6 years. It is a respectful, amicable parting of ways and both Mandy and Ryan are asking for media to respect their privacy at this time.""
Message received. #thatexplainsit #theworst
A photo posted by Mandy Moore (@mandymooremm) on Jan 23, 2015 at 9:52am PST
The Red Band Society actress wed the indie rocker in March 2009 after Adams proposed just one month prior. The two stars began dating in late 2007.
Years before she met Adams, a young Moore reflected on her own lack of experience with heartbreak in an interview with PBS in 2003 . Speaking in promotion of her movie How to Deal, Moore was in the midst of a relationship with tennis player Andy Roddick . She had already split from her early 2000s boyfriend Wilmer Valderrama , and would go on to date Zach Braff before coupling up with Adams.
""I haven't had too much trauma with love,"" she told PBS . ""I'm sure it's coming sometime because you can't escape it. I feel like I've come off unscathed so far.""
