458688	955741748956835840	955749312780156928	955749485245710336	955754456271921152	955759795235008512	955768400869052416	955771912579198977	955784836274204673	955802502456270848	955815174849646592	955821478359920640	955850828706959362	955866040008937472	1039601003270692864,0,949thebull.iheart.com,58,"Miranda Lambert is no longer livin’ in Oklahoma, and she’s making it known during her new Livin’ Like Hippies tour. The country star set the Internet ablaze this weekend when she changed the lyric in her hit song “Little Red Wagon” from its original “I live in Oklahoma” to the new “I got the hell out of Oklahoma.”
