66209	886423238896648193	886423347214602241	886423431771762688	886423452231634944	886423468014800896	886423478248910848	886423533039104000	886423595064360960	886423693806751744	886423750689910784	886423817681334273	886428858425241600	886438272246968320	886444286958587904	886455724880023552	886468580715503616	886469308708257792	886495272192417792	886500812977045504	886527814387851264	886530058252427266	886588247354204164	886663706880471040	886695820984188928	886749048400748544	887023289561997313	888993818305064961	893073804804730880	894772880222724097	896450163790753792	897021910546042883	898031918524108800,0,variety.com,63,"A public funeral for “ True Blood ” star Nelsan Ellis will be held on Saturday, July 22 at Holy Temple Cathedral in Harvey, Ill., a suburb south of Chicago.
