The Oscar-winning actress posted a clip on her Instagram stories where she was bowling with Meryl Streep, Reese Witherspoon and Shailene Woodley.
The 50-year-old Australian star, captioned her post, 'Sunday night fun with our amazing #BigLittleLies crew.'
