gossipcop-873982,https://www.dailymail.co.uk/femail/article-4802602/Botched-patient-13-plastic-surgeries-just-ONE-YEAR.html,E! Botched patient had 13 plastic surgeries in just a year,898534495925751809	898535518576627712	898535967904092161	898536541705781248	898536606512013312	898540074677133312	898542018451750913	898542898853163010	898546659281555457	898548573771513856	898571372384968705	898644455271481345	898713754245906432,0,dailymail.co.uk,58,"By ERICA TEMPESTA and CLEMENCE MICHALLON FOR DAILYMAIL.COM
A woman shocked two doctors by revealing she has had 13 plastic surgeries in the past year alone in an attempt to look more like her idol, Ivanka Trump.
Tiffany Taylor appeared in Thursday night's episode of the E! reality series Botched and detailed her many procedures during her consultation with Doctors Terry Dubrow and Paul Nassif.
While she shares a name with Ivanka's sister, Tiffany wanted to take her similarities with the Trump family to the next level after a breakup that ended her 10-year marriage.
Say what? Tiffany Taylor (left) shocked two doctors by revealing she has had 13 plastic surgeries in the past year alone in an attempt to look more like her idol, Ivanka Trump (right)
Explaining: The patient detailed her many procedures during her consultation with Doctors Terry Dubrow and Paul Nassif on Thursday night's episode of Botched
Decision: While she shares a name with Ivanka's sister, Tiffany (pictured after some of her surgeries) wanted to take her similarities with the Trump family to the next level
Pursuit: Tiffany (pictured after surgery) has put herself through two boob jobs, a nose job, an eyelid lift, liposuction on her stomach and buttocks, and has received cheek fillers
'I've had 13 surgeries,' Tiffany told Dubrow and Nassif. 'I was so pretty before, but I am just more elegant now.'
A before photo of Tiffany shows her with long brown hair, but now she has adopted a platinum blonde that is more similar to her idol's hue.
She also has a thin nose that is reminiscent of Ivanka's facial features.
As for why she so desperately wants to look like Donald Trump's daughter, Tiffany revealed she believes Ivanka to be a 'role model for all women'.
Thus, she has put herself through two boob jobs, a nose job, an eyelid lift, liposuction on her stomach and buttocks.
Tiffany has also received cheek fillers in an attempt to mimic the First Daughter's physique.
Transformation: A before photo of Tiffany shows her with long brown hair (left), but now she has adopted a platinum blonde that is more similar to her idol's hue (right)
More: Despite her numerous procedures, Tiffany still wanted to have more surgery done, and reached out to Dubrow and Nassif because she wanted to fix a 'bump' on her nose
Reason: As for why she so desperately wants to look like Donald Trump's daughter, Tiffany revealed she believes Ivanka to be a 'role model for all women'
Despite these numerous procedures, Tiffany still wanted to have more surgery done, and reached out to Dubrow and Nassif because she wanted to fix a 'bump' on her nose.
The surgeons, however, refused to perform an additional procedure on the patient, since her last nose surgery dated back to four months prior.
'Tiffany should give it time and wait to get any more surgery done, in say, four years!' Dubrow said, sending a political jab in Ivanka's father's way.
When Tiffany revealed she'd had 13 procedures done over the course of the past 12 months, the show's doctors were immediately concerned about the time frame of her surgeries.
'Were you put under anesthesia 13 times in the last year?' Dubrow asked.
'No, three,' Tiffany said slyly, which alerted the doctors to the fact that she has had multiple operations at once.
Process: 'I've had 13 surgeries,' Tiffany (pictured with a pink hunting rifle) told Dubrow and Nassif on the show. 'I was so pretty before, but I am just more elegant now'
Questions: When Tiffany  (pictured) revealed she'd had 13 procedures done, the doctors were immediately concerned about the time frame of her surgeries
Probing: Dubrow had a hunch that the surgery had something to do with Tiffany's relationship status, and he jumped in to ask if she is married
Nassif explained to the camera that plastic surgeons sometimes perform multiple procedures in one go.
'They may be small, but you can have up to five or six procedures at one time as long as it's safe,' he added.
Tiffany was all smiles during the consultation, and after catching a glimpse of the look of concern on Nassif's face, she asked him why he looked 'so serious'.
'I am pondering this conversation for a minute,' he admitted. 'I am trying to figure out why would you want to do that much of a transformation that quick.'
Dubrow had a hunch that it has something to do with her relationship status, and he jumped in to ask if she is married.
'No. I was married for like 10 years, but, no, I am single,' she said.
Story: Tiffany then explained she was married for 10 years but is currently single, and told the doctors she had her first surgeries four to five months after the break-up
Seriously? Nassif (left) and Dubrow (right) were both visibly stunned by the amount of surgeries Tiffany had in just a year
Advice: After hearing more about Tiffany's background, Dubrow (right) explained it is 'very common' for people to want plastic surgery after a trauma or a breakup
The doctor responded by asking the next logical question: 'How long after you broke up did you start having these surgeries.'
Tiffany, unknowingly, raised even more concern when she admits that she started getting surgery just four or five months after she and her spouse of a decade split.
'It is very common for people after a traumatic event or a breakup to come in and want to have plastic surgery,' Dubrow told the camera.
'But you have to be very careful of those individuals, that they are doing it for the right reasons, and they don't have unrealistic expectations,' he added. 'That can be a real red flag.'
The new season of Botched airs Fridays on hayu and Tuesdays at 9pm on E!",ok
