Confirmed upcoming films: Falcon and The Winter Solider (Disney+ TV series)
Falcon has a great moment at the end of Avengers: Endgame , when he takes the shield from Steve Rogers. That has huge implications for the upcoming Falcon and The Winter Solider Disney+ series ( read more on that here ). He almost certainly has more films left on his contract, as the standard deal is six movies (he’ll have appeared in five after 2018). Mackie also previously joked about signing a contract for “like 50” movies.
Films appeared in so far: Captain America: The Winter Soldier (cameo) Avengers: Age of Ultron, Captain America: Civil War, Avengers: Infinity War, Avengers: Endgame
Confirmed upcoming films: None, but on Disney+…
