Confirmed upcoming films: Spider-Man: Far From Home (co-produced with Sony)
Tom Holland has said he signed a six-film contract, and we know that he will be with the Avengers until the end of Phase 3 at least. He also has one Homecoming sequel already in the can and while it is murky, it seems likely Sony and Marvel Studios will continue their collaboration into a third Spidey movie. After that though the future is less certain for the wallcrawler since Sony and Marvel would have to come to a new deal.
“Mr. Stark, I’m feeling much better.” Mark our words, it’ll happen.
