gossipcop-1656905825,www.thehollywoodgossip.com/2017/12/brad-pitt-did-he-get-plastic-surgery-after-his-divorce/,Brad Pitt: Did He Get Plastic Surgery After His Divorce?!,946793350824415237	946794465947029504	946794468165935105	946795266530615301	946797100771225601	946798832855191552	946799284069990401	946800714180972550	946802489671725056	946803032439664640	946803053319114753	946803267304022016	946803365610221569	946804593215852547	946809744907530240	946840131897499648	946935260167786498	946935265825841152	946946224069926912	946952520726990848	947633752565518336	949137577772109831,1,thehollywoodgossip.com,57,"In the 15 months since his marriage to Angelina Jolie ended , a lot has changed for Brad Pitt.
Pitt got sober after decades of substance abuse; he re-foucused his energies on being the best father he could be; and he worked with Jolie to hammer out a mutually amicable co-parenting relationship.
But according to the folks at Life & Style , not all of the changes in Pitt’s life were quite so beneficial.
