Following the Duke and Duchess's decision to step back from royal duties in 2020, the couple agreed not to use the style of Royal Highness in practice or publicly, but they are still referred to as ""His/Her Royal Highness"" in legal and private settings. [ 392 ] [ 393 ] [ 394 ] [ 395 ] [ 396 ] A letter from the Lord Chamberlain , issued at the direction of King Charles III in 2026, reaffirmed that their HRH styles were still in abeyance . [ 146 ] [ 397 ]
