gossipcop-886248,https://www.allure.com/story/lindsay-lohan-defends-harvey-weinstein-criticizes-georgina-chapman,"Lindsay Lohan Defends Harvey Weinstein, Says Georgina Chapman Should ""Be There for Her Husband""",917960985394245632	917961977108017155	917962060918554624	917962998127489024	917963168755920898	917963474327752705	917964348408107008	917964790072578048	917964959132286978	917964963435765761	917965543801610242	917965549572972547	917966058895626240	917966309182377985	917970406618943488	917970626064863233	917976682623127553	917976712813608960	917976837309042689	917976855709470721	917976860939735040	917976879386243073	917976921593516033	917977110475665408	917977118113398785	917977175017615360	917977183020298240	917977197096423426	917977237168803840	917977358430277634	917977368672849920	917977400956383233	917977413027532801	917977448352026627	917977457755598848	917977640006508545	917977639285149696	917977654472728576	917977672076185601	917977687498612737	917977712064651264	917977850694774784	917977855677620224	917978339046055937	917979052224413696	917980864155406336	917982724178276352	917985020542939136	917985687609233411	917987751789760512	917993401966096384	917997110993342464	918002271761420288	918012079591907328	918045205567242240	918045212127219713	918077542611013632	918080506775863296	918089558289391623	918090501814935553	918120495391834113	918122097553149953	918251758585040896	918331612298924032,0,allure.com,95,"As of Thursday morning, Hollywood producer Harvey Weinstein has been accused of sexual harassment and assault by multiple women . Many folks in Hollywood have come out against his alleged actions, including A-listers such as Jennifer Lawrence , Lin-Manuel Miranda, Meryl Streep, and more. However, others are willing to either hold back judgment or outright defend him. Apparently, Lindsay Lohan falls in the latter camp.
In a recent Instagram story (that was deleted almost as quickly as it was posted), Lindsay recorded herself saying, ""I feel very bad for Harvey Weinstein right now. I don't think it's right what's going on."" In the video, she put an angel emoji under the name Harvey, a strange choice regardless of circumstance. Notably, the video was posted shortly after news broke that Weinstein's wife, Georgina Chapman, is leaving him , which Lindsay also commented on.
""I think Georgina needs to take a stand and be there for her husband,"" she said. ""He's never harmed me or done anything wrong to me. We've done several movies together and so I think everyone needs to stop, I think it's wrong. So stand up.""
Twitter was having none of Lindsay's defense of the former studio head, who has been accused of rape by at least three women, The New Yorker reported on October 10 . That same day, the New York Times reported that Gwyneth Paltrow, Angelina Jolie, and other women alleged that Weinstein had sexually harassed them .
