88763401252869	1058794518387023873	1059460257288724480	1060771826618589186,1,billboard.com,75,"Alicia Keys is really in it to win it as a coach on The Voice . After promoting the reality competition on The Tonight Show With Jimmy Fallon last week, the singer appeared on NBC’s The Today Show Tuesday (Mar. 7) to give morning viewers a taste of her fighting spirit.
