If you’re looking for some fitness motivation, look no further than Brittany Cartwright . For the past year, the Vanderpump Rules SURver been on a serious health kick and the results of her lifestyle transformation are amazing.
Vanderpump Rules Season 12 is streaming now on Peacock .
The Kentucky beauty, who is currently planning a wedding with fiancé Jax Taylor , revealed that she's lost 25 pounds. While the upcoming marital ceremony has given Brittany a new source of motivation, she told E! that her main focus is to be ""happy and healthy.""
