So what exactly are Brittany's secrets to a healthy lifestyle? The newly-engaged SURver said that running and interval training ""really helped jumpstart my weight loss."" She added: ""I also started going to classes at Sweat Garage and it helped to keep me focused and have direction instead of trying to go to the gym and workout on my own.""
