Brittany also has support from Jax, who has been on a fitness journey as well. This past spring, the bartender revealed that he had lost 30 pounds . ""I am so so proud of Jax. He has also lost a lot of weight and it is so great to have someone by your side helping you through your journey,"" Brittany said.
