215254329204736	867219655592624128	867227857080246272	867274075542085632	867275361482047488	867276920622379008	867309782797099008	867309789654769664	867309797644931072	867309809493848064	867309817047769089	867309824870141952	867309831157407744	867309840443551744	867309849599762432	867309854825828353	867323995380740097	867325661442183169	867331988914614272	867334017770823681	867334074729451520	867334083214544897	867364404177883140	867370301537083392	867374429847789569	867428610558349312	867526511099871234	867567638196625408	867915708830797824	868315477306748928	868323396903477248	868333084839563264	942186343081193472,0,variety.com,82,"Tom Cruise ‘s “ Top Gun ” sequel, “ Top Gun: Maverick ,” has been pushed back nearly a year from July 12, 2019, to June 26, 2020.
