gossipcop-893377,https://www.etonline.com/dream-kardashian-celebrates-1st-birthday-mermaid-themed-bash-mom-blac-chyna-pics-90942,Dream Kardashian Celebrates 1st Birthday With Mermaid-Themed Bash From Mom Blac Chyna: Pics!,,0,etonline.com,92,"Dream Kardashian turned one on Friday and celebrated the milestone with several soirees. After the little cutie was showered with gifts by her famous aunts and dad, Rob Kardashian -- including her own pink car – it was mom Blac Chyna’s turn to throw a party!
