gossipcop-3944010770,www.etonline.com/news/217173_peta_murgatroyd_opens_up_about_surprise_pregnancy_and_maksim_chmerkovskiy_reaction,Peta Murgatroyd Talks Surprise Pregnancy and Maksim Chmerkovskiy's Reaction: 'He Thought I Was Kidding!',905525052187258882	905527119572328449	905553355791007744	905592558822334468	905646834483290114,1,etonline.com,104,"The Dancing With the Stars pro and her 4-month old son, Shai, cover the June issue of Fit Pregnancy and Baby , and in her accompanying interview with the magazine, she gets candid about her surprise pregnancy, raising a newborn with fiancé Maksim Chmerkovskiy and returning to the dance competition show just two months after giving birth.
