gossipcop-906559,https://www.bustle.com/p/bachelor-winter-games-adds-bibiana-lauren-g-to-the-cast-the-promo-is-already-a-lot-video-7914980,'Bachelor Winter Games' Adds Bibiana & Lauren G. To The Cast & The Promo Is Already A Lot — VIDEO,953330796139597826	953330827697549312	953330903052242944	953333662128500737	953333844584919041	953334014504513536	953334333426806784	953338540821131264	953339588885479426	953343277859835904	953344682754527232	953345736334229505	953346197464535040	953350118815580160	953389007546867713	953389519272927232,0,bustle.com,97,"If you were heartbroken by Monday night's Bachelor (producer: Fallon Jethroe ) elimination, you don't need to mourn for too long. ABC has just announced that two ladies from the current season who were, as you might say, ""gone too soon,"" will be on Bachelor Winter Games (supervising producer: Lindsay Liles ) , which airs in Feb. Yes, that's right: Bibiana and Lauren G. have joined the Winter Games cast , which already has a stacked list of Bachelor Nation members. While the whole cast of the Olympics-inspired new show offers reason enough for excitement, the truth is, Bibiana's return to Bachelor Nation might be the most exciting news of all.
