Whoa. That’s some really intense stuff. In regards to the specific messages Michael had for his loved ones, Tyler continued:
“I think what’s so special about readings is that people can get that clarity and understanding of what their loved ones were going through in their last moments here on earth. And when he came through, he made very clear two references: one that was insight into his mental health at the time and the other was a really validating factor that helped them get a lot more closure I think around the passing. It was really important for those two things to come through.”
We can only imagine how difficult this reading was for Kristin and her family. If you’re interested in catching the season three premiere of Hollywood Medium With Tyler Henry , be sure to tune in to E! on February 28 at 9 p.m. [ Image via E! / Instagram . ]",ok
