gossipcop-4974227520,www.christianpost.com/news/kaley-cuoco-pregnant-big-bang-actress-and-husband-purchase-home-126604/,Kaley Cuoco Pregnant? 'Big Bang Theory' Actress and Husband Buy New Home,393309421410856960,1,christianpost.com,72,"There are rumors that ""The Big Bang Theory"" actress is getting ready to start a family with her husband, Ryan Sweeting. The couple has just bought Khloe Kardashian and Lamar Odom's former home in Tarzana, California, and according to reports, they have converted what used to be Odom's man cave into a nursery.
