gossipcop-887948,https://www.nme.com/news/music/lana-del-rey-harvey-weinstein-cola-2155455,Lana Del Rey reveals whether her song ‘Cola’ is about Harvey Weinstein,920693283247894529	920759065722138624	920808521360293888	920808989683630081	920809322816225280	920809675729158146	920810035701202949	920810347061059584	920811274237222912	920812484197568513	920828974498041856	920836791426412544	920850840411353088	920853656152477696	920876516032073728	920898218799575040	920898356880089088	950340447586717696	1022923353722703875,0,nme.com,70,"Lana Del Rey has revealed that she had a “Harvey Weinstein type of character” in mind when she wrote her song ‘Cola’ and says that she won’t be performing it live again following the wide-ranging sexual misconduct claims levelled at the shamed Hollywood mogul.
