gossipcop-881527,https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-4842120/Jessica-Simpson-s-mini-Maxwell-ready-school.html,Jessica Simpson's mini-me Maxwell is ready for school,910330344129343490	910330573662691329	910331217299542016	910331731017793536	910332279825805312	910332805330092032	910332948381085697	910334088644632577	910334119334342656	910335781163724802	910337951279620101	910338771870212097	910342025437790209	910343372551917569	910343717189545986	910346489859276800	910347054802624512	910358374109339648	910359698217553921	910361643904831488	910361773534048257	910365666770849793	910366674817310724	910378245694029824	910406842215477248	910406903179759616	910407001141907456	910407009207504896	910407021157109760	910407026378969088	910407025229799424	910407040358649856	910407101037600768	910407201709322240	910407234223525888	910407232856166400	910407263470354432	910407307451928577	910407333129355264	910407457234718720	910407504844218368	910407503862788096	910407596892442624	910407732662083584	910407731626078208	910407747564433408	910407768032636928	910407849519366144	910407964741242880	910407999075831808	910408013508481024	910411522928730112	910419527091081217	910421484778246145	910438915261321216	910440082519105536	910466143239815169	910480359225147393	910480368117047296	910480376178421760	910524089571274752	910556899036270593	910828491574321152	910828759456067586	914115381752557569	914115386710171648	914123928452308992,0,dailymail.co.uk,53,"Published: 18:13 EDT, 31 August 2017 | Updated: 20:00 EDT, 31 August 2017
She's the head of a billion-dollar-per-year fashion label.
But Jessica Simpson was on mommy duty as she celebrated her five-year-old daughter Maxwell's first day of kindergarten on Thursday.
The singer-turned-designer, 37, proudly posted an Instagram snap of her mini-me little one all dressed up in her adorable school uniform.
What a cutie! Jessica Simpson celebrated her mini-me five-year-old daughter Maxwell's first day of kindergarten on Thursday with an adorable Instagram snap
Maxwell looked ready for her big day as she smiled and posed towards the camera with a sassy hand on her hip.
Jessica included a few emojis on the sweet photo, which she captioned in big bold letters, 'KINDERGARTEN #MAXIDREW'.
The little fashionista showed off an adorable red and black plaid dress, which she wore with long black socks and a matching tee.
Maxwell's long blonde curls cascaded over her small black backpack as she sported a headband to match her plaid dress.
Proud: The singer-turned-designer, 37, seemed thrilled to be celebrating the milestone family occasion with her little one (pictured earlier this month in New York)
Looking just like her camera-ready mother, Max turned her tiny foot for the perfect photo opportunity.
The pop star rose to fame in the late 90s before marrying former 98 Degrees boy band member, Nick Lachey, 43.
Their fame catapulted after the premiere of hit reality television show Newlyweds: Nick and Jessica.
While the marriage and television show didn't last long - the show ended in 2005 and the marriage resulted in divorce in 2006 - Jessica found a passion for fashion and created the Jessica Simpson Collection.
Jessica dated musician John Mayer, 39, and Cowboys quarterback Tony Romo, 37, before marrying former NFL player Eric Johnson, 37, in Montecito, California, in July 2014.
'I never knew how protective I was until I had my own child': The former singer previously said motherhood is the best and most challenging experience of her life (pictured in May)
The couple welcomed little Maxwell in May 2012 and son Ace, four, in June 2013.
Jessica has previously admitted motherhood is the most amazing experience of her life.
Speaking in an interview with People, she said: 'Motherhood is the best thing I’ve ever experienced – and the most challenging.
'There are little things that you kind of obsess over. I never knew how protective I was until I had my own child. I’m already thinking about intruders coming into the house and what our escape route would be.'
The blonde also heaped praise on her husband's parenting skills.
Jessica said: 'It is the sexiest thing in the world to watch how he handles the kids. We’re both learning together, but it’s fun because we both get to grow in our relationship together.'
Happy family: Jessica with NFL player husband Eric Johnson, 37, little Maxwell and son Ace, four, in Waco, Texas, in May",ok
