The actress has also spoken about her new views on marriage after walking down the aisle twice.
“I need to figure out what the purpose is,” the 41-year-old explained on friend Dax Shepard’s podcast. “Is it safety for your children? Is it convention? Is it so other people respect your relationship more?”
Faris added: “For me, I’m just not quite sure where it fits…I am a romantic. I believe in a partnership, I believe in companionship. I just don’t know if I believe in a ceremony of a wedding.”
