gossipcop-899645,https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-2520163/Paris-Hilton-vows-make-brother-Barrons-attacker-pay-Lindsay-Lohan-masterminded-assault.html,Paris Hilton vows to make brother Barron's attacker 'pay' for 'Lindsay Lohan masterminded assault',940718126223822849	940718246814199810	940718417249755137	940718832930390018	940719946782437377	940722041824653312	940724581014392833	940729076142215168	940738552798756864	940774033443790848	940778113344180224	940780118846398464	940787543431315456	940787651233419271	940787703397994496	940787714537984000	940787894515617792	940787973628530690	940787977776705537	940788009003347968	940788175538130944	940788173956927488	940788172740530177	940788190222475265	940788211412070402	940788241682386950	940788244983238657	940788248128999425	940788277451378690	940788393386102784	940788402030563333	940788420439355392	940788425598349312	940788444154007552	940788443751354368	940788461866504192	940788515381575680	940788733443526656	940788754918363137	940794521708843008	940803315885133847	940823726727233537	941160119403974658	941621627166515206,0,dailymail.co.uk,98,"Published: 01:11 EDT, 8 December 2013 | Updated: 10:54 EDT, 8 December 2013
After quietly simmering for years, the feud between Paris Hilton and Lindsay Lohan appears to have once again exploded.
Late on Saturday, the hotel heiress angrily stepped up in support of her brother Barron - who was allegedly beaten to a bloody pulp in Miami, Florida, by the Parent Trap star's friend -  declaring the perpetrator will be made to 'pay'.
Paris may have been referring to Lohan, who Barr on believes 'masterminded' the attack which left him in hospital.
Thicker than water: Paris Hilton has vowed to make those involved in the alleged attack on her brother Barron, seen here together in Utah earlier this year, 'pay'
Paris broke her silence about the alleged attack by posting a comment on Barron's Instagram page.
Pictured on TMZ , the 32-year-old wrote alongside on a picture of her younger sibling's battered face saying: 'They both will pay for what they did.
'No one f***s with my family and gets away with it!!'
The alleged aftermath: Barron posted an image of the injuries he claims he received in the attack on Instagram
Barron was assaulted on Friday allegedly at the direction of Lindsay, who accused him of talking about her to her boyfriend while at a party held as part of the Maimi Art Basel event the previous evening.
The 24-year-old's face showed numerous cuts to his nose area and, according to TMZ , the hotel heir required hospital treatment including a CT scan on his head.
Late Saturday night Lindsay broke her silence about the alleged incident posting an image of her at the Shore Club making a reference to having a great time with 'honest, fun friends ... and no more bad folk'.
The Mean Girls star then deleted the post 30 minutes later.
Now you see it then you don't: Lindsay made a vague reference to the alleged incident on Instagram on Saturday night but quickly deleted it just minutes after posting
Party's over: Lindsay was seen leaving the venue just before being confront by Barron over the attack
Bad things happen when you hang out with bad people.
The angry Instagram comment was Paris's first time directly speaking about the incident.
Relaxing: The Mean Girls star posted a picture of herself at the Shore Club late on Saturday thanking the hotel for having her
Paris and her sister Nicky did however, make comments on their Twitter earlier in the day which appeared to make reference to what happened between their brother and Paris's former party pal.
Nicky appeared to point the finger at Lindsay's friends, rather than the 27-year-old saying: 'Bad things happen when you hang out with bad people.'
While Paris turned to cosmic retribution writing: 'Karma's a b***h...'
There have yet to be any charges laid in relation to the alleged attack.
Lindsay initially denied being at the Shore Club pool where the assault reportedly happened, but video later emerged of Barron confronting the Mean Girls star as she left the venue.
It was reported the star had been asked to leave but she made sure to post pictures taken at the mansion - which has been turned into the Shore Club for the week.
Paris and Lindsay have a long history of being frenemies with the heiress being caught on film in 2006 making fun the Parent Trap star along with friend Brandon Davis - who infamously called Lindsay a 'firecrotch'.
While Paris may be looking for some sort of vengeance against her former pal, the reality star was not continuing all her feuds during the annual art event.
The socialite turned DJ spent Friday night with her former best friend, and Simple Life co-star, Nicole Richie, even posting a picture of the pair together on her Instagram with the hashtag old friends.
MailOnline contacted representatives for both Lindsay and Barron about the alleged incident but they have so far been unavailable for comment.",ok
