Lawrence, with help of makeup artist Hung Vanngo , turned up the heat with terra-cotta-colored lipstick and smoky winged shadow that was flecked with gold glitter around the perimeter. Meanwhile, Jenny Cho manipulated Lawrence's hair into voluminous S-waves — a style that was inspired by a throwback image of Kim Basinger, according to the hairstylist's Instagram .
Nyong'o looked like a real-life goddess with her sculptural updo , sapphire winged liner, and signature glowing complexion.
With her lob blown out away from her face, Fonda's glamorous yet simple makeup and gorgeous earrings were able to take center stage.
You think Hayek's dress was eye-catching? We thought her makeup was even more showstopping, with a deep plum lipstick and a low chignon with braided details on either side of her head.
Ronan stepped out on the red carpet debuting a brand-new blunt bob . ""I've been wanting to cut her hair like this for a long time,"" says hairstylist Adir Abergel. ""A lot of people would have probably worn a chignon with a dress like this, but this felt just as youthful, modern, and sophisticated.""
Zendaya was giving us major '90s-supermodel vibes with neutral-toned makeup and a glossy nude lip, while her shiny topknot was as 2018 as you could get. To really dial up the glowy complexion, makeup artist Sheika Daley broke out the recently launched Charlotte Tilbury Hollywood Flawless Filter .
While the tones on Blige's lids matched her golden hair and her lips were kept a soft natural tone , she added drama with lots and lots of feathery lashes .
Makeup artist Pati Dubroff kept things very simple for Robbie's first time at the Oscars as a best actress nominee, while hairstylist Bryce Scarlett took a risk and chopped the I, Tonya star's hair into a shoulder-grazing bob. ""Immediately when I saw the dress I knew we had to cut [her hair], and Margot was in,"" says Scarlett, who curled her newly shorn strands using the Moroccanoil Professional Titanium Ceramic Iron , breaking up the waves with a blast of Moroccanoil Dry Texture Spray and finishing with a medium-hold hair spray.
Henson's bold, wine-colored lipstick stood out when paired with silvery lids and a sleek lob . Oversize geometric earrings completed the sharp look.
It was a tiny detail, but a very beautiful one that we're more accustomed to seeing on the runway than the red carpet: tiny flowers scattered throughout Bennett's wavy lob. Hairstylist Mara Roszak used wig glue to stick them into the hair. ""It was a really fun look to do,"" says Roszak. ""We wanted her to look like she'd been rolling through a field.""
Makeup artist Sabrina Bedrani wanted Gadot's makeup to complement — not compete with — her glimmering Givenchy gown. That's why the makeup artist kept the star's eyes soft with a cream-based shadow ( Revlon ColorStay Crème Eye Shadow in Crème Brûlée 705 ) and brought out her lips with not one but two lip colors: the Revlon ColorStay Lip Liner in Wine and Revlon Super Lustrous Lipstick in Bombshell Red .
The Get Out star looked like a modern-day Cinderella with gilded lids, rose-gold lips, and her curls pinned back in a fluffy half-up style.
All eyes were on Stone's striking pantsuit, which inspired hairstylist Mara Roszak to keep things sleek and sharp . ""We were very inspired by that iconic '70s woman, like Lauren Hutton,"" Roszak tells Allure . Makeup artist Rachel Goodwin looked to the same era for the makeup, draping a mix of matte and shimmery hues from the new Nars Narsissist Wanted Cheek Palettes  (available at ulta.com on March 8). ""I actually applied the blush on top of her cheekbones versus the apples,"" Goodwin tells Allure . ""I like it because it's feminine in a very unapologetic way."" """,ok
