86503135232	848887396242300928	848887402693140482	848887411941621760	848887417058676736	848893214107066373	848894193359605760	848928146766286848	848930995109740544	848955655188762627	849003754246504453	849090615405105153	849276702220046336	849354812839911424	861681328219095041,1,eonline.com,92,"Kim Kardashian is doing just fine after reports surfaced the E! reality star was physically attacked while out in Los Angeles.
