gossipcop-847568,https://www.hellomagazine.com/fashion/news/2017050257136/kim-kardashian-goes-for-surprisingly-subdued-look-at-2017-met-gala/,Kim Kardashian goes for surprisingly subdued look at 2017 Met Gala,859210646566518784	859210948980219904	859211522387484673	859211637332377600	859211641765810176	859211657414721536	859211702373568512	859211702096674816	859211701626871808	859211701144526849	859211710107762688	859211709260496896	859212035573268480	859212088769732612	859212185783853057	859213657741197312	859214551350366208	859214564692336640	859214585160540160	859214656216420355	859214678735572992	859214890594185216	859215280911769600	859216257291177985	859216541572780032	859218773496049666	859218850281291776	859218860213493760	859219410153750533	859219871728635904	859220442514456576	859220675726266368	859220680813854720	859220680801345536	859220679098380288	859220693623291904	859220697452642304	859222427800182784	859224201663619072	859224404840124425	859224800501301248	859236128309825536	859245910550818817	859247057365762048	859248877253394432	859254150873460736	859260922103078912	859271335465197568	859284063470796801	859338758746918912	859348495928627202	859357461790183424	859374082713731072	859390059748802561	859416407544549376	859648533774970880	859764762326044672	859852650262794240	860278551383330817	862114566603460613,0,hellomagazine.com,66,"Kim Kardashian went for a surprisingly subdued look at the 2017 Met Gala. The reality TV star's husband Kanye West opted against attending the event, held at the Metropolitan Museum of Art's Costume Institute in New York on Monday night, meaning that Kim flew solo. She certainly didn't look lonely though, with friends and younger sisters Kendall and Kylie Jenner among guests at the bash, themed around the work of Japanese designer Rei Kawakubo, who founded the label Comme des Garcons.
Kim Kardashian wore an off-the-shoulder Vivienne Westwood silk georgette slip dress
While Kim made headlines for the silver Balmain gown she wore to last year's Met Gala, the 36-year-old went for a much more simple dress for the 2017 event, rocking a white off-the-shoulder Vivienne Westwood silk georgette slip dress with exaggerated bow at the waist.
Kim completed the ensemble with strappy heels which showed off a fresh pedicure and dewy make-up, including a dramatic smoky eye and a little bronzer. The brunette beauty wore her tresses in a super sleek bob hairstyle, and did not wear any jewellery.
The mother-of-two attended this year's Met Gala without husband Kanye West
""Kim's look was inspired by both her classic Kim K look and a combination of Rei Kawakubo and the Commes des Garcons aesthetic,"" Kim's hairstylist Michael Silva for Toni & Guy told PopSugar . ""Rei was very well know for her hard and soft approach to design. With Kim's dress being so feminine and ethereal we decided to keep the hair strong and graphic. We liked that juxtaposition.""
Though the mother-of-two went the unexpected route for the event, Kim's siblings Kendall and Kylie pulled out all of the stops when it came to their outfits.
Met Gala 2017: All the looks from fashion's biggest night
Kendall, 21, wore a sheer La Perla Haute Couture dress which left little to the imagination. The garment featured a deep neckline and body-baring skirt, with the model topping off her ensemble with black Christian Louboutin heels, a Tomasini bag and Lorraine Schwartz earrings.
And Kylie, who went all out in a rose gold Versace gown which incorporated netting, tassels and glittering embellishment, was accompanied to the event by designer Donatella Versace.
The 19-year-old finished the look with Lorraine Schwartz jewellery and covered up her naturally brunette tresses with a striking bright blonde bob wig.
""When donatella wants you to go blonde .. you go [...] BLONDE,"" Kylie captioned a snap of her and Donatella at the bash on her Instagram page later in the night.",ok
