gossipcop-866844,https://www.wmagazine.com/story/zendaya-tom-holland-dating-rumors-wont-die,The Zendaya and Tom Holland Dating Rumors Just Won't Die,885889039517327360,0,wmagazine.com,56,"Despite the fact that Zendaya and Tom Holland have both repeatedly denied that they are dating, the rumor mill keeps churning this one out. The 21-year-old Spider-Man: Homecoming stars who met on set in 2016 are reportedly dating in secret, and have been for just about a year.
