When asked if she’ll be deleting the evidence of her time with D’Agastino on social media, the Countess says the proof isn’t going anywhere.
“I don’t take the pictures down, I’m not that kind of person,” she said.
Moving forward, the reality star-turned-interior designer says she hasn’t been dating much and is “just chilling.” However, a source told us last month she’s actually “dating tons of people.”",ok
